WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Open Import Betslip and upload a synthetic sportsbook screenshot.

00:04.000 --> 00:08.000
Luna processes the screenshot. Review the extracted draft.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.000
Correct the event, kickoff, market, selection, line, and odds when needed.

00:12.000 --> 00:16.000
Choose Continue to review the market and selection.

00:16.000 --> 00:20.000
Confirm the canonical event and details when available.

00:20.000 --> 00:24.000
Choose Continue, then select a Study or No Study — Personal.

00:24.000 --> 00:28.000
Confirm stake, American odds, and total return, then choose Review draft.

00:28.000 --> 00:32.000
Check the final editable summary and choose Confirm and save the import.

00:32.000 --> 00:34.000
Open My Bets and verify the successful imported wager.
